@startuml seq_007_conflict
' ============================================================
' Title:     SEQ-007 Conflict
' Source:    docs/spec/contracts/conflict/
' C4:        ResolveConflict (domain · not peer) used by compilation_application
'            and inspections_application; human path via findings_application
' Package:   conflicts_domain · findings_application · artifacts_infrastructure
' API:       GET /artifacts · GET /artifacts/{artifact_id}
'            POST /artifacts/{artifact_id}:reviewConflictArtifact
' UseCase:   ResolveConflict · ReviewConflictArtifact
' Contract:  docs/standards/VERSION
' ============================================================
!include common/seq_styles.puml
!include common/seq_identities.puml

title $TITLE_SEQ_CONFLICT

actor "$ACTOR_RO" as RO
actor "$ACTOR_SYS" as SYS
box "Interface" #$SEQ_INTERFACE
  participant "$P_CLIENTS" as CL #$SEQ_INTERFACE
  participant "$P_API" as API #$SEQ_INTERFACE
end box
box "Application" #$SEQ_APPLICATION
  participant "$P_CR_APP" as CR #$SEQ_HERMETIC
  participant "$P_INS_APP" as INS #$SEQ_APPLICATION
  participant "$P_FIND_APP" as FIND #$SEQ_APPLICATION
end box
box "Domain" #$SEQ_DOMAIN
  participant "$P_RESOLVE" as RES #$SEQ_DOMAIN
end box
box "Infrastructure" #$SEQ_INFRASTRUCTURE
  participant "$P_ART_REPO" as ART #$SEQ_INFRASTRUCTURE
end box
box "Frameworks" #$SEQ_FRAMEWORKS
  database "$P_ART_STORE" as ASTORE #$SEQ_FRAMEWORKS
end box

autonumber

== ResolveConflict during CompileDirectives / RunInspectionPipeline (not freestanding API) ==
SYS -> CR: CompileDirectives / evaluate path
activate CR
CR -> RES: ResolveConflict.detect_and_resolve
activate RES
RES --> CR: deterministic outcome or open conflict
deactivate RES
alt human action required
  CR -> ART: write conflict artifact kind=conflict
  ART -> ASTORE: append_only conflict_artifacts
  ASTORE --> ART: artifact_id
  ART --> CR: ConflictArtifact
end
deactivate CR

== Get conflict artifact · $API_GET_ARTIFACT ==
RO -> CL: inspect conflict
CL -> API: $API_GET_ARTIFACT
activate API
API -> FIND: load via artifacts read
FIND -> ART: Get
ART -> ASTORE: read
ASTORE --> ART: ConflictArtifact
ART --> FIND: ConflictArtifact
FIND --> API: Artifact / ConflictArtifact
API --> CL: 200 Artifact
deactivate API

== ReviewConflictArtifact · $API_REVIEW_CONFLICT · operationId reviewConflictArtifact ==
RO -> CL: ReviewConflictArtifact
CL -> API: $API_REVIEW_CONFLICT\nReviewConflictArtifactRequest · Idempotency-Key
activate API
API -> API: CapabilityEnforcer.Authorize(conflict.resolve)
API -> FIND: ReviewConflictArtifact.execute(artifact_id, decision)
activate FIND
FIND -> ART: append resolution version
ART -> ASTORE: append_only new version · binding_status resolved
ASTORE --> ART: ConflictArtifact
ART --> FIND: ConflictArtifact
FIND --> API: ConflictArtifact
deactivate FIND
API --> CL: 200 ConflictArtifact
deactivate API

footer $DIAGRAM_ID_SEQ_CONFLICT · $FOOTER_SEQ
@enduml
